&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is seeking a&amp;nbsp;Director, EMEA Ecommerce for Fanatics Collectibles will be responsible for delivering sales through commercially driven strategies, online marketing, merchandising, user experience, and site operations for Topps.com and developing our 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party Marketplaces. This role demands a true cross-functional leader to oversee a team that delivers against strategic goals and work hand-in-hand with our digital, product, tech and marketing teams, ensuring the achievement of key performance metrics and operational excellence. The ideal candidate will have a robust understanding of digital retail and be familiar with navigating and optimizing listings on major Ecommerce platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports directly to the Sr. Director of Global Ecommerce and will work closely with the rest of the Fanatics Collectibles executive leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Topps.com:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a comprehensive topps.com strategy to achieve revenue and profitability targets across EMEA markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine appropriate product launch strategy (e.g. traditional, pre order, auction) for each release that will drive sales velocity, profitability and maintains brand integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead merchandising strategies to ensure a compelling product assortment, timely updates, and effective promotions that align with collector trends and market demand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze key performance indicators (KPIs) and operating metrics. Implement improvements based on data-driven insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep understanding of the dynamics of the various product lines sold on Topps.com (Hobby, Topps NOW, Mass Market)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional forecasting Topps.com releases based on historic product performance and emerging customer behaviour trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end execution of product launches, from pre-launch planning and marketing activation through to launch and post-purchase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success criteria for launches and own weekly, monthly and quarterly reporting across site performance, sales and key commercial KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously optimise the Topps.com collector experience, identifying opportunities to grow GMV and margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute structured tests across new activations, propositions and commercial strategies, using results to deepen understanding of the EMEA collector base and improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Growth (Lifecycle, Performance and Affiliates), Technology, Finance, Analytics and external agencies to deliver commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across Fanatics Collectibles business units to identify opportunities to acquire and grow collectors across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; Party E-Commerce:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a comprehensive 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party e-commerce strategy to achieve revenue and profitability targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new growth opportunities and innovative approaches to maximize sales across various 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships and negotiate commercial terms with new 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower the team to test &amp;amp; learn by measuring program effectiveness, providing insights on how to optimize in future. Lead analysis of all programs and establish programs to drive continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the day-to-day operations of 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party e-commerce channels, including product listings, pricing, promotions, and inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party e-commerce operations comply with relevant regulations, policies, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and mitigate potential risks related to 3&lt;sup&gt;rd&lt;/sup&gt; party platform operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, eCommerce, or a related field. MBA preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 7-10 years of eCommerce experience including DTC, with at least 5 years in a leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3rd Party marketplace experience highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in driving eCommerce sales and marketing strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in demand planning , sensing, and pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of online merchandising and user experience best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills with the ability to interpret data and translate insights into actionable strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidate must have keen business acumen, advanced online customer analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional leadership and team development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong curiosity, interest, and intrigue for the trading cards industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including ----- For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Sales Manager at Mews, you will own a territory—and own it at scale. You have 3+ years of proven quota attainment, and you&#39;ve demonstrated ambition to grow and take on increasingly complex challenges. You will close larger deals, build scalable playbooks, and serve as an ambassador for sales excellence across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mews powers 15,000+ properties across 85 countries. In 2025, we processed nearly $20 billion in transactions. In 2026, we raised $300 million in Series D funding at a $2.5 billion valuation. We are approaching IPO. The market is global, the product is unmatched, and the territories are genuinely winnable at scale. The question is whether you are the person to own a territory and lift the entire team&#39;s standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;351&quot; data-local-id=&quot;215fb90a5af3&quot;&gt;&lt;mark id=&quot;a22f7726-560b-4c94-9d38-27bcfc998281&quot; class=&quot;css-100s7ye&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-mark-type=&quot;annotation&quot; data-mark-annotation-type=&quot;inlineComment&quot; data-id=&quot;a22f7726-560b-4c94-9d38-27bcfc998281&quot; data-mark-annotation-state=&quot;resolved&quot; data-has-focus=&quot;false&quot; data-is-hovered=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-you-would-do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;What you would do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Full ownership of a territory with quota targets, closing deals (€5,000+)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Strategic territory growth planning: building 2-3 year plans, not just quarterly targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Working with Multi-stakeholder deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;A pipeline built from outbound prospecting, with strategic account planning and targeted expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Mentoring and coaching of Sales Managers—not just your own discipline, but their development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Thought partnership with commercial leadership on scaling motions, team development, and market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Representation of the sales team across cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;974c86851289&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;768&quot;&gt;Use AI to redesign how your territory and team work, not just how you personally work. Build an AI-powered territory analysis framework your team follows. Create deal-coaching workflows that scale your mentoring. Actively question what AI gives you and know when to abandon an output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1664&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4180db2f048a&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve redesigned how your territory and team work using AI, not just how you personally work. You&#39;ve built approaches other Sales Managers follow—whether it&#39;s an AI-powered territory analysis framework, a prospecting workflow that uses AI to prioritize accounts, or a deal-coaching process that scales your mentoring. You actively question what AI gives you, push back when it&#39;s wrong, and know when to abandon an output entirely. At &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;IC3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, you&#39;re thinking about how to multiply yourself through AI and through your team, not just how it speeds up your own work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2247&quot; data-local-id=&quot;87a5f0f2b3c3&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-you-would-bring&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You have 3–5+ years of quota-carrying sales experience, with 3+ years of full-cycle closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You have achieved 100%+ of quota in at least 2 consecutive years, proving sustained performance at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You have diagnosed and fixed market-level problems—not just closed deals, but rebuilt territories or built new motions from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You know your numbers—ARR targets, attainment rates, deal progression, pipeline metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You can map your growth across roles: where you started, where you peaked, and why you moved on. You&#39;re ambitious about your own growth and you seek out bigger challenges and higher complexity. You move strategically to environments where there&#39;s genuine room to expand and where you can keep leveling up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You build scalable playbooks and mentor others—Sales Managers come to you for advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You have a 2-3 year territory vision and can break it into actionable strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;Track record of territory turnarounds or market expansion from zero&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;You understand what drives you. You tie compensation to personal earnings ambitions and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;22b546661822&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2381&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3 or equivalent: you&#39;ve redesigned how work gets done using AI, built approaches others follow, and actively question AI output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£52,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£65,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hanover is an award-winning communications consultancy that advises enterprises, institutions, and individuals on building recognition and enhancing reputation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;From our offices across Europe and the Middle East, we adopt an integrated approach that connects the dots across channels, audiences and issues.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our collective of smart, curious people think differently and live by a shared mission, purpose, vision, and values. These shape how we work, not just with our colleagues, but with clients and partners too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to ‘rewire communications for impact’ and harness its transformative power to advocate, trailblaze and make a difference.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We do this by igniting and empowering the potential of every individual within our company, recognising that each person is a unique spark, capable of creating extraordinary impact. We believe that by nurturing and harnessing the collective brilliance of our people, we can drive innovation, foster an uncommon work culture, and make a positive difference to society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Embracing the complete range of skills and services across the communications spectrum without constraint, we create the best outcomes for our clients and deliver world-class work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly motivated and skilled Account Executive to join our Healthcare Communications team, joining a team of experts in product PR, patient advocacy, crisis management, disease awareness, corporate communications and media relations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Executive provides high-quality public relations services to Hanover’s existing healthcare clients, together with timely research and administrative support for new business activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Account Executive is also responsible for supporting media outreach, providing administrative support for client meetings, and establishing demonstrably credible working relationships with clients, where appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Primary Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of the media, with the goal of identifying opportunities for coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft high quality materials for client review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain relevant records of target stakeholder and audience groups relevant to your clients and sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver specifically assigned areas of each discrete/new project to agreed timescales, on budget and to a high quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct value-add research and produce high quality draft intelligence reports for existing clients and sector specific new business meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft client meeting agendas and effective action notes arising from internal account meetings and sector specific new business meetings, together with efficient maintenance of new business databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute towards selected new business pitches as part of the wider team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in a relevant PR and communications position from either a public relations consultancy or in-house communications team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge and understanding of healthcare communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communications skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and highly organised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective time management and strong organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working collaboratively as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable interest in media, news and current affairs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, your core benefits package will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus potential linked to recruitment, new business and long service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days’ annual leave (plus bank holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private healthcare and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension plan, including 5% employer contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also have access to a wide range of opportunities and initiatives, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working policies, plus eligibility to apply for a sabbatical after 2 years’ service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Summer Fridays finish (3pm) – early Friday finish the rest of the year (4pm)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Hanover Academy, which incorporates training, coaching, mentoring and reverse-mentoring opportunities to support personal development and career progression across all levels, with a generous training budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International secondments as well as the opportunity to collaborate with all offices across the AVENIR GLOBAL’s network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A wellbeing programme, featuring (but not limited to) pre- and post-maternity leave coaching, a working parents’ group, subsidised gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our Culture Club, with a robust social calendar all year round and CSR activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion Statement +&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hanover Communications is an equal opportunities employer, committed to creating and ensuring a fair, inclusive, and diverse work environment where all individuals are treated with respect and dignity. We believe that equality and diversity are essential to high performance and a thriving culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We maintain a strict no-tolerance stance against any form of discrimination and harassment, ensuring all individuals are treated equitably, irrespective of their race, ethnicity, religion, beliefs, age, sex, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, marital or pregnancy status, genetic background, or any other attribute safeguarded under our company policies or federal, state or local laws and legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to ensure that our hiring process is accessible. If you need reasonable accommodation for any part of the application process, please send an email to &lt;a ---------- with the nature of your request.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to transparency about how we collect and use your data, including ensuring we comply with legal obligations relating to data protection. You can view our data privacy policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://hanovercomms.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hanover is part of AVENIR GLOBAL’s powerhouse of specialist communications consultancies across EMEA and North America. Collectively we rank among the top 15 largest communication firms in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hanovercomms.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;Hanover&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hanovercomms.com/careers/&quot;&gt;working for us&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Motorsport)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DO YOU WANT TO WORK FOR THE WORLD LEADER IN ELITE SPORTS PERFORMANCE ANALYTICS?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a world leader in sports performance technology, serving over 5000 teams across 40 sports. We improve many of your favorite athletes&#39; performances with our wearable tracking technology, video and data analysis systems, and athlete management products. Our technology offers objective solutions to sport-based challenges and can be found throughout the NFL, NHL, NBA, AFL, NRL, Premier League, Bundesliga, La Liga and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Motorsport, Catapult’s SBG race management and team strategy systems are the technology of choice for elite-level organisers and competitors around the world, including in Formula 1, Formula E, IndyCar, NASCAR, WEC/Le Mans and other worldwide endurance racing. Customers include the FIA (in F1, F2, F3, F1 Academy, FE and WEC), nine Formula 1 teams (including the 8-time World Champion Mercedes AMG Petronas F1 Team), the majority of Formula E teams, the winners of multiple Le Mans 24-hour races over the last 10 years (Audi, Porsche, and Toyota) and teams and organisers in both IndyCar and NASCAR.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have major offices in the UK (London and Leeds), USA (Boston) and Australia (Melbourne) as well as multiple smaller offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SPORTS AND WANT TO WIN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a talented and enthusiastic &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer (Motorsport)&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to grow our Motorsport development team as we expand our RaceWatch products into new series and tackle new challenges.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Based in London, you will be a key player in developing new capabilities in RaceWatch, particularly for Endurance racing strategy, but also contributing to the entire RaceWatch suite across different racing series.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe that our customers deserve the best platform, and we are on a mission to maximise and enhance their performance through delivering the highest quality experience. As a Senior Software Engineer, you will help us drive our products and processes forward, as well as acting as a mentor and providing technical leadership to other team members. You will be able to excel in a fast-paced environment with short project timelines from conception to deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of our RaceWatch software for one or more motorsport series.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product managers and customers to design features and prioritise tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify ways to add innovative new features to the software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead others to anticipate and meet customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be one of the technical leaders within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain efficient, reusable, and reliable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure code quality, organization, and best practices throughout the development process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead with a growth mindset, encouraging others to share ideas and opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and enhance software reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for Motorsport.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years working in a fast-paced, technical environment, delivering software to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building applications in C/C++.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing products, scaling them, and supporting them throughout the entire lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for working with complex data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills and an ability to communicate effectively with technical and non-technical staff, both internally and when speaking to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to go above and beyond for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to help cover live motorsport events at weekends on a rotational basis with the rest of the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to multi-task and thrive in a dynamic work environment with changing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in computer science or other scientific or technical subject.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working in motorsport is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the challenges faced by motorsport officials and teams in managing and participating in events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Catapult’s RaceWatch software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ticketing and project management platforms, such as JIRA or Monday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing Windows applications in Visual Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing applications that process video.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CATAPULT?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have amazing people. We can promise you will work with some of the most ambitious and intelligent people in an exciting industry, and you will do some of the best work of your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We encourage our people to have constructive, open and honest communication; to make Catapult extraordinary; innovate and create smart solutions; establish a collaborative, yet challenging, environment to develop our performance and the performance of our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our workforce spans more than 20 countries so you’ll have the opportunity to work across multiple nationalities and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value improvement and development. We are challenging ourselves to continuously grow and become a high-performance company. That means we maintain a growth mindset in everything we do, and our people are always looking for ways to do things better. There is unlimited opportunity to grow, do more, and do better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care about you. We offer outstanding paid maternity and paternity leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you are interested in sports or not, you’ll have the satisfaction of knowing your work is supporting some of the most successful teams, organisations and competitors on the planet! While we have access to many exciting opportunities, we also realize that we are here to do a very important job for our customers. As a result, we aim to work with purpose and intention. We look for people that fit into our team culture, those who actively contribute and individuals who are excited about what they do.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to build the future of sports performance, we need the brightest talent. If you think you can contribute to the empowering, enjoyable and exciting Catapult environment, then we invite you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All offers of employment are subject to Catapult&#39;s positive prehire check. To find out more, please contact the Talent Partner for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

